slider76:0<0,100,1>-Open hat drive (%)
slider77:0<0,100,1>-Tom drive (%)
slider78:0<0,100,1>-Perc drive (%)
slider79:0<0,100,1>-Cymbal drive (%)
slider80:0<0,3,1{Clean Boost,Germanium Console,Line Driver,Transistor Matrix}>-Drive81 circuit
slider81:0<0,2,1{Off,High,Low}>-Drive81 band
